{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FRIF_SECTION_7_6_2_FlexRay_NM_PDU_format","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_FlexRayNetworkManagement","page":33,"text":"7.6.2 FlexRay NM-PDU format\nAs specified in [SWS_FrNm_00147] the FlexRay NM is capable of sending NM-Vote\nand NM-Data independently. Therefore several corresponding PDU formats exist for\nthe NM-Vote and for the NM-Data. To also support an associated transmission of NM-\nVote and NM-Data in the static segment the NM-Data PDU contains an optional Voting\nBit.","caption":"7.6.2 FlexRay NM-PDU format","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FRIF_SECTION_7_6_2_FlexRay_NM_PDU_format","releases":["R23-11"],"page":32,"hash":"ac91242dd9eba0ec","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/ddc4a58d15a4/page_32.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FRIF_SECTION_7_6_2_FlexRay_NM_PDU_format","releases":["R24-11"],"page":34,"hash":"1d6265d6ee67707e","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/55ac2f2a835f/page_34.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FRIF_SECTION_7_6_2_FlexRay_NM_PDU_format","releases":["R25-11"],"page":33,"hash":"9723815714242b18","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/9890c2b2730b/page_33.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/9890c2b2730b/page_33.webp","trel":"R25-11","tstat":"section","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_FrNm_00147] im Text von SWS_FlexRayNetworkManagement.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_FrNm_00147"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}